# Lead Capture Backend — FastAPI + MongoDB

Build a complete, production-ready FastAPI backend for lead capture inside `backend/`. The existing `.venv` will be used as-is.

## Proposed Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Client / Next.js Frontend] -->|HTTP| B[FastAPI App]
    B --> C[Auth Router - /auth]
    B --> D[Leads Router - /leads]
    C --> E[Auth Service]
    D --> F[Leads Service]
    E --> G[MongoDB - users collection]
    F --> H[MongoDB - leads collection]
    E --> I[JWT Utilities]
    I --> J[Token Blacklist - MongoDB]
```

