### 5. Leads Endpoints

#### [NEW] [routers/leads.py](file:///d:/Programming/lead-desk/backend/app/routers/leads.py)

| Endpoint | Method | Auth | Description |
|----------|--------|------|-------------|
| `/leads` | POST | Public | Submit a new lead (validated) |
| `/leads` | GET | Admin | List leads with search + pagination |
| `/leads/{id}` | GET | Admin | Get single lead by ID |
| `/leads/{id}` | PATCH | Admin | Update lead status only |

**GET /leads query params:**
- `search` — searches across `name`, `email`, `message` (case-insensitive regex)
- `page` (default 1) and `page_size` (default 20, max 100) — offset-based pagination
- `sort_by` (default `created_at`) and `sort_order` (default `desc`)

**Response format:**
```json
{
  "leads": [...],
  "total": 42,
  "page": 1,
  "page_size": 20,
  "total_pages": 3
}
```

